This directory holds ORIGINAL work — hero building models, vehicles, street
furniture, UI and shaders. It does NOT hold anything derived from Hong Kong government open data.
Generated assets live in game/assets/generated/, are gitignored, and are governed
by the DATA.GOV.HK Terms and Conditions of Use instead. Do not mix the two.
That includes the mesh-sourced hero models (HKCEC): they are repainted government
meshes built by the ETL into game/assets/generated/landmarks/, and they can never
move here, whatever they look like.

CC BY-SA 4.0 is one-way compatible with GPL-3.0-or-later, which is what lets
these assets combine into the GPLv3 game without a licence clash. The rest of the
repository is GPL-3.0-or-later; see ../../../LICENSE.

A licence is not a depiction right: these models depict real, identifiable Hong
Kong landmarks, and CC BY-SA governs only our copyright in the model.

See LICENSING.md at the repository root for the full policy and its reasoning.
